WEBVTT

00:04.250 --> 00:09.880
ずっと信じている

00:04.250 --> 00:09.880
zutto shinjite iru

00:04.250 --> 00:09.880
I have always believed

00:10.010 --> 00:14.390
終わらない夢を握りしめて

00:10.010 --> 00:14.390
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

00:10.010 --> 00:14.390
in taking hold of that endless dream.

00:14.390 --> 00:17.680
TRUST ME MY WAY

00:27.400 --> 00:31.320
DON'T MIND 時にこの想い

00:27.400 --> 00:31.320
DON'T MIND toki ni kono omoi

00:27.400 --> 00:31.320
I don't mind... sometimes feeling like

00:31.320 --> 00:34.030
空回りするけど

00:31.320 --> 00:34.030
karamawari suru kedo

00:31.320 --> 00:34.030
I'm just spinning my wheels, but...

00:34.490 --> 00:37.700
‘ちょっとポジティブ’がいいんじゃない？

00:34.490 --> 00:37.700
chotto POJITIBU ga iinjanai

00:34.490 --> 00:37.700
Why don't you act a little more positive?

00:37.830 --> 00:41.420
自分らしいキャラでいい

00:37.830 --> 00:41.420
jibunrashii KYARA de ii

00:37.830 --> 00:41.420
You should be yourself.

00:41.540 --> 00:47.260
でもね... ハチャメチャなシナリオは

00:41.540 --> 00:47.260
demo nee... HACHAMECHA na SHINARIO wa

00:41.540 --> 00:47.260
But you know... a messed up scenario

00:48.920 --> 00:54.430
愛すべき 未来に変わって いく

00:48.920 --> 00:54.430
aisubeki asu ni kawatte iku

00:48.920 --> 00:54.430
will turn into a lovable tomorrow.

00:54.430 --> 00:55.930
TRUST MY WAY

00:55.970 --> 01:01.390
THE WIND 頬をなでる

00:55.970 --> 01:01.390
THE WIND hoho wo naderu

00:55.970 --> 01:01.390
The wind... it caresses my cheek.

01:01.650 --> 01:05.070
風と-緒に心地好く

01:01.650 --> 01:05.070
kaze to issho ni kokochiyoku

01:01.650 --> 01:05.070
Together with this comfortable breeze,

01:05.070 --> 01:09.950
楽しめる速度でこれからも

01:05.070 --> 01:09.950
tanoshimeru sokudo de kore kara mo

01:05.070 --> 01:09.950
and at a rate I also enjoy,

01:10.070 --> 01:15.580
ずっと変わらない想い

01:10.070 --> 01:15.580
zutto kawaranai omoi

01:10.070 --> 01:15.580
these feelings won't ever change.

01:15.830 --> 01:20.160
終わらない夢を握りしめて

01:15.830 --> 01:20.160
owaranai yume wo nigirishimete

01:15.830 --> 01:20.160
I"m taking hold of that endless dream.

01:20.160 --> 01:23.790
TRUST ME MY WAY

01:36.830 --> 01:39.070
Izumi-san, please wake up.

01:39.720 --> 01:40.530
Wake up!

01:42.160 --> 01:43.120
Mitsuki...

01:43.830 --> 01:45.470
Let me sleep a little longer.

01:45.740 --> 01:47.470
Please wake up.

01:48.610 --> 01:49.530
Izumi-san.

01:55.960 --> 01:57.530
Izumi-san...

02:06.610 --> 02:11.590
Couples Formed Under Extraordinary Circumstances Don't Last Long, You Know.

02:12.640 --> 02:13.710
Yoshitaka!

02:13.910 --> 02:16.070
How dare you sneak in here!

02:17.020 --> 02:19.020
Today you shall breathe your last!

02:20.290 --> 02:21.550
You disgraceful...

02:23.170 --> 02:23.740
Huh?

02:24.510 --> 02:25.480
A-Anna-chan?

02:26.580 --> 02:28.940
Good morning, Izumi-san.

02:29.480 --> 02:32.940
I decided to work as a live-in maid as well.

02:33.380 --> 02:34.750
Please look after me!

02:36.500 --> 02:38.150
What's wrong, Izumi-san?

02:38.630 --> 02:40.540
Now we'll always be together!

02:40.620 --> 02:42.390
We can't do that!

02:44.140 --> 02:48.060
The schedule I set up is moving along at a good pace.

02:48.470 --> 02:51.040
Starting today, I'll have another middle-school maid.

02:51.530 --> 02:52.600
Master!

02:53.760 --> 02:54.750
Anna-chan!

02:57.090 --> 02:59.090
Ah, Pochi!

03:03.920 --> 03:05.240
Damn you, Pochi!

03:09.400 --> 03:11.950
What are you looking at? What are you looking at? What do you think you're looking at?

03:12.220 --> 03:14.720
I'm going to crush you!

03:14.860 --> 03:16.950
Take this, and this, and this!

03:17.510 --> 03:21.760
Just as I thought, I can't let Anna-chan stay in a mansion with a pervert like you around!

03:21.950 --> 03:23.940
Would you like some coffee, Master?

03:23.970 --> 03:24.720
Huh?

03:24.720 --> 03:25.500
What are you doing?

03:25.860 --> 03:27.290
Like I said, it's coffee.

03:27.470 --> 03:28.730
Because I'm a maid...

03:28.860 --> 03:31.150
No, you can't work in a place like this!

03:31.260 --> 03:32.690
What did your family say about this?

03:33.120 --> 03:35.870
I lied and told them I was going to a nunnery.

03:36.110 --> 03:38.320
Your parents accepted that?

03:39.510 --> 03:42.280
My expectations about how those clothes would look on you were surpassed...

03:43.630 --> 03:44.970
But my, it suits you well!

03:45.300 --> 03:47.330
Much, much more than Izumi-san!

03:47.490 --> 03:48.080
Here you are.

03:48.320 --> 03:49.540
Ah, thank you, thank you.

03:52.260 --> 03:53.650
Here, Master!

03:53.800 --> 03:54.230
Huh?

03:54.520 --> 03:54.990
Me?

03:55.290 --> 03:55.940
Yes!

03:55.940 --> 03:57.080
Ah, no!

03:57.080 --> 03:57.920
What happened?

03:57.970 --> 03:58.920
Is that how it is?

03:58.950 --> 04:00.250
I-I see now!

04:00.880 --> 04:05.580
But if add a clause to your contract that states that you're only supposed to revere me as your Master...

04:05.750 --> 04:06.410
There it is!

04:06.820 --> 04:10.210
You think I'll let you, you filthy animal?

04:10.870 --> 04:11.600
Ah, the contract!

04:11.860 --> 04:13.110
Stop it, Izumi!

04:14.630 --> 04:16.640
What are you doing to Izumi-san?!

04:18.950 --> 04:19.620
That's hot.

04:19.790 --> 04:21.540
I won't let it happen.

04:21.720 --> 04:25.040
It's bad enough that Mitsuki and I are his victims!

04:27.000 --> 04:27.970
Wait, a voice!

04:28.130 --> 04:29.590
The voice of one of my maids!

04:30.450 --> 04:31.150
Huh? What are you...

04:31.220 --> 04:31.720
Help me!

04:31.920 --> 04:33.210
Help me!

04:33.300 --> 04:34.470
You're right. That's Mitsuki's voice!

04:34.950 --> 04:35.720
Where is she?

04:37.140 --> 04:37.840
Who's that?

04:37.500 --> 04:39.420
Help me, help me.

04:39.890 --> 04:42.210
Hel-help mm...

04:49.050 --> 04:49.640
Mitsuki!

04:52.250 --> 04:55.330
We, the Mitsuki-chan Bodyguard Squad, have taken possession of Mitsuki-chan.

04:55.690 --> 05:00.570
We cannot ignore Yoshitaka's oppression of Mitsuki-chan, so we've taken a stand!

05:00.820 --> 05:01.790
Huh?

05:02.450 --> 05:03.790
Stop fooling around and get out!

05:04.000 --> 05:04.890
This is my house!

05:05.160 --> 05:06.330
You can't have her without a fight!

05:06.610 --> 05:08.690
Shut your mouth, smartass!

05:09.330 --> 05:12.200
You said you're Izumi and Mitsuki-chan's master?

05:12.660 --> 05:15.340
You're a bratty kid who couldn't protect a single girl!

05:15.930 --> 05:19.920
I absolutely couldn't believe it when Mitsuki-chan told me about it!

05:20.430 --> 05:22.700
I can't allow this kind of behavior to go on!

05:23.370 --> 05:25.220
From now on, Mitsuki-chan is the master of this house!

05:25.710 --> 05:29.940
If you want to get Mitsuki-chan back and resume your position,  you'll have to go through us first!

05:30.260 --> 05:32.200
Well, it's not like you can, of course.

05:32.540 --> 05:33.820
No, let me go!

05:33.840 --> 05:34.520
Help me!

05:34.570 --> 05:35.270
Onee-chan!

05:35.320 --> 05:36.910
Master!

05:38.400 --> 05:39.260
Mitsuki!

05:39.930 --> 05:40.830
What should we do?

05:40.970 --> 05:42.180
Mitsuki doesn't want this!

05:43.950 --> 05:44.870
Yoshitaka?

05:44.970 --> 05:48.610
They came into my mansion, took my maid, my electronic guns, and my... and my...

05:50.510 --> 05:51.210
I CAN'T ALLOW THIS!

05:51.430 --> 05:53.730
I swear I'm going to get her out of there and take everything back!

05:53.840 --> 05:55.010
Let's go, people!

05:55.270 --> 05:56.570
First we need to gather some weapons!

05:59.060 --> 06:00.600
It looks like it went pretty well.

06:02.260 --> 06:04.340
Let's ambush them as planned.

06:06.760 --> 06:09.630
My... But still, Mitsuki-chan, you really come up with some interesting things!

06:09.840 --> 06:11.250
I can't believe we're doing a survival game.

06:11.440 --> 06:12.590
Is it a bother?

06:12.910 --> 06:13.700
No, no, no, no.

06:13.720 --> 06:14.820
If it's for Mitsuki-chan...

06:15.300 --> 06:19.470
I'm sure Master will come rescue me 'Die Hard' style!

06:19.760 --> 06:21.750
Well then, Kumeshin-san, you'll be the colonel!

06:21.750 --> 06:22.230
Huh?

06:22.230 --> 06:22.720
COLONEL?!

06:22.870 --> 06:23.750
Wh-Wh-Which colonel?

06:24.980 --> 06:26.320
Now, sit down and let's get ready.

06:28.760 --> 06:29.360
Colonel...

06:29.860 --> 06:30.550
That has a nice tone to it!

06:31.630 --> 06:32.440
Ah, I made a mistake!

06:32.690 --> 06:34.050
This is the colonel from Akira!

06:34.160 --> 06:35.950
I thought it would be like Simon, but...

06:36.260 --> 06:37.330
I'm sorry.

06:38.430 --> 06:39.160
Dammit...

06:39.740 --> 06:41.260
Everyone to your positions!

06:41.440 --> 06:42.290
Understood, Colonel.

06:42.600 --> 06:44.810
No, we've been waiting for those words!

06:44.920 --> 06:46.330
It's time for that fool Yoshitaka...

06:46.490 --> 06:46.940
Shut up!

06:47.240 --> 06:48.780
I don't need to hear your words. Just run!

06:49.000 --> 06:50.210
We can't let you stand!

06:50.610 --> 06:51.930
That's not quite right...

06:52.420 --> 06:53.890
Do your best, all right...

06:55.090 --> 06:56.200
Master.

06:58.430 --> 07:00.300
How can we sneak in?

07:00.480 --> 07:01.580
Those guys!

07:01.620 --> 07:03.250
They're using my electronic gun collection!

07:03.860 --> 07:07.500
We're unarmed, we have no chance of winning a frontal assault!

07:08.860 --> 07:09.480
Pochi?

07:11.980 --> 07:13.010
The ventilation shaft!

07:13.070 --> 07:14.160
That's how we are going to do it!

07:15.360 --> 07:17.860
Now we can get in without them noticing!

07:18.280 --> 07:20.990
But, shouldn't I take up the rear in this case?

07:21.670 --> 07:23.720
You just want to do it for the view!

07:23.820 --> 07:24.850
Take the front!

07:25.180 --> 07:26.120
That's right!

07:26.140 --> 07:29.310
Izumi-san's rear is all mine!

07:31.640 --> 07:33.370
Anna-chan, stop that!

07:33.580 --> 07:36.130
Whoa, whoa, whoa, wa-wa-wait that's not fair!

07:37.280 --> 07:39.470
Don't touch me there!

07:39.600 --> 07:40.450
This is Togusa!

07:40.490 --> 07:42.030
They've made it inside!

07:42.810 --> 07:44.170
We're treating men and women the same!

07:43.920 --> 07:44.220
Nice...

07:44.220 --> 07:45.280
Don't take us lightly.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.050
Pochi's gone!

07:51.420 --> 07:52.080
Pochi...

07:55.720 --> 07:57.520
That hurts...

07:58.250 --> 07:59.510
Hey, isn't this the bathroom?

08:00.700 --> 08:02.810
Why does Pochi know all these secret passages?

08:03.140 --> 08:04.130
Right now, that doesn't matter.

08:04.320 --> 08:06.640
To tell you the truth, I would really like to question him on that, but...

08:07.040 --> 08:08.140
They fell into the bathroom!

08:09.280 --> 08:10.300
According to plan.

08:10.640 --> 08:11.410
Mach 5!

08:10.640 --> 08:17.090
The phrase 'mahha go' ("Mach 5") is a reference to the series 'Mahha GoGoGo' (マッハGoGoGo), also known as Speed Racer.

08:12.530 --> 08:13.610
All right!

08:13.690 --> 08:15.780
If we're in the bathroom, that means my room is across the hall!

08:15.910 --> 08:17.090
I have some weapons there!

08:19.010 --> 08:22.660
But why is your room across the bathroom, Yoshitaka-kun?

08:23.740 --> 08:24.660
That's because...

08:25.010 --> 08:27.750
It's easy to peek when someone is in the bath, obviously!

08:28.910 --> 08:29.980
Or coming out of the bath!

08:31.420 --> 08:32.820
Or when they're changing clothes!

08:34.990 --> 08:38.110
So you even see when she's in her underwear and still warm from the bath?

08:38.300 --> 08:39.800
Of course I do!

08:40.730 --> 08:41.890
Die!

08:41.920 --> 08:43.000
Die, you giant lecher!

08:43.300 --> 08:45.050
You giant pervert! Giant pervert! Giant pervert!

08:45.600 --> 08:48.030
Take this, and this, and this, and this!

08:49.480 --> 08:50.260
Put your hands up!

08:50.560 --> 08:50.990
Ah, wait!

08:51.020 --> 08:51.580
N-N-N-No!

08:51.780 --> 08:53.280
Th-That's se-seriously dange...

08:53.550 --> 08:54.140
SHUT UP!

08:55.350 --> 08:56.260
Open fire!

08:59.320 --> 09:00.130
Cooperate and come out!

09:01.250 --> 09:02.290
Don't just yell and run away!

09:02.570 --> 09:04.490
We have to beat them if we're going to go any further!

09:04.690 --> 09:06.640
But they have guns... I'm scared!

09:07.030 --> 09:07.740
What are you talking about?!

09:08.600 --> 09:09.500
Wh-What are you doing?

09:11.270 --> 09:14.500
I can't believe you two servants would use your master as a shield!

09:14.530 --> 09:15.620
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

09:22.320 --> 09:23.560
You're incredible, Pochi.

09:25.050 --> 09:25.600
Really, bravo.

09:27.560 --> 09:28.860
All right, it's my room!

09:28.950 --> 09:29.670
Pick a gun!

09:30.070 --> 09:31.560
I'll take this, and this, and this.

09:31.810 --> 09:32.650
Here, Izumi, this is for you.

09:32.720 --> 09:33.610
And Anna-chan, this is for you.

09:34.900 --> 09:37.660
Hey, Yoshitaka, don't you think there's something strange about this?

09:37.800 --> 09:38.360
What do you mean?

09:38.510 --> 09:41.060
The Bodyguard Squad took their weapons from here, right?

09:41.330 --> 09:43.690
Why are there enough left for us?

09:44.100 --> 09:45.440
They probably couldn't take them all.

09:48.030 --> 09:49.180
It really suits you.

09:49.370 --> 09:50.520
All right, let's go!

09:51.010 --> 09:53.350
Hey, don't you think they're planning something?

09:54.450 --> 09:55.670
Dumbass!

09:55.980 --> 09:56.840
This is my house!

09:57.180 --> 09:59.020
These are my stomping grounds!

09:59.320 --> 10:01.590
Even if we think that they're planning something,

10:02.050 --> 10:04.440
I doubt that there are any traps I don't know about in this ma...!

10:09.720 --> 10:11.300
Izumi-saaaan!

10:35.270 --> 10:36.630
It's useless to try and slow them down.

10:36.840 --> 10:39.620
They run at you no matter how many rounds you fire at them!

10:39.850 --> 10:40.470
They're zombies!

10:40.820 --> 10:41.740
The enemies are zombies!

10:42.450 --> 10:44.420
I thought I could become Mitsuki-chan's support, but I failed.

10:44.730 --> 10:46.900
But you, Colonel...

10:47.390 --> 10:48.350
Relax.

10:48.600 --> 10:51.160
I will be certain to protect Mitsuki-chan in your place.

10:51.540 --> 10:52.750
Thank you very much.

10:53.590 --> 10:55.980
Then I have no regrets.

10:56.090 --> 10:56.620
Death.

10:57.000 --> 10:58.280
Did you hear that, you worms?!

10:58.520 --> 11:01.240
The enemy is death, they're zombies!

11:01.530 --> 11:02.660
They're the living dead!

11:07.000 --> 11:08.030
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

11:09.380 --> 11:11.430
Why is there a mat in a place like...

11:15.300 --> 11:16.260
I'm sorry, Izumi!

11:16.880 --> 11:18.650
It wasn't on purpose, it wasn't on purpose!

11:20.420 --> 11:20.960
Huh?

11:21.730 --> 11:22.610
No reaction?

11:23.510 --> 11:24.140
Izumi?

11:24.510 --> 11:25.180
Hey!

11:25.480 --> 11:27.180
Time to wake up...

11:30.680 --> 11:32.440
I'm going to lift your skirt...

11:34.000 --> 11:34.870
Izumi!

11:35.380 --> 11:37.710
Hey, how long are you going to sleep?

11:39.650 --> 11:40.340
Izumi?

11:43.860 --> 11:44.420
I-It can't be!

11:44.420 --> 11:45.720
Hey, Izumi!

11:46.020 --> 11:46.410
Pull yourself together!

11:46.520 --> 11:47.020
Hey!

11:50.050 --> 11:52.360
This is... the contract between Anna and I.

11:52.630 --> 11:53.730
So this is where it was?

11:59.730 --> 12:01.270
My happy ending!

12:06.330 --> 12:08.940
Master was really startled!

12:10.700 --> 12:14.730
Izumi-san, why did you leave me behind?

12:14.890 --> 12:17.450
That's not fair, you and Yoshitaka being alone.

12:17.890 --> 12:20.560
If we were alone together, I would do this and that...

12:21.590 --> 12:22.570
Ah, I'm so jealous!

12:22.670 --> 12:23.680
I can't stay still!

12:24.190 --> 12:25.820
I have to look for Izumi-san!

12:27.280 --> 12:28.590
We'll go save her!

12:31.130 --> 12:32.150
What's this room?

12:32.760 --> 12:33.350
Izumi in
the Bath

12:32.760 --> 12:33.350
Izumi
Changing
Clothes

12:33.460 --> 12:34.220
Izumi in
the Bath

12:33.460 --> 12:34.220
Don't tell me!

12:35.170 --> 12:36.850
What were you doing, just now?

12:37.730 --> 12:41.170
While I was unconscious... you did something weird, didn't you?

12:42.520 --> 12:43.500
Dumbass!

12:43.660 --> 12:44.880
I was worried about y...

12:44.970 --> 12:47.650
Then you can truthfully say you didn't do anything you feel guilty about?

12:48.630 --> 12:51.460
Ah, well, I kind of, you know, messed with your skirt a litt...

12:51.890 --> 12:54.250
Just as I thought, you did something, you beast!

12:54.380 --> 12:56.300
No, I stopped halfway...!

12:56.380 --> 12:56.940
Idiot!

12:56.980 --> 12:59.780
How can you not be... serious at a time like this?!

13:02.080 --> 13:02.720
Huh?

13:03.400 --> 13:04.900
We were in the hallway?

13:05.180 --> 13:05.670
Now!

13:05.790 --> 13:06.520
It's the zombies, the zombies!

13:06.710 --> 13:07.440
Kill them all!

13:07.530 --> 13:08.250
Fire, fire!

13:10.970 --> 13:11.660
The Bodyguard Squad!

13:12.120 --> 13:13.240
This is not the time to argue!

13:13.730 --> 13:15.230
No matter what, we're breaking through!

13:20.150 --> 13:21.010
Wow, that's cool!

13:21.270 --> 13:23.080
I saw a similar picture in a certain girl simulation game!

13:23.230 --> 13:25.470
Don't just sit there and stare. Back me up!

13:30.440 --> 13:31.730
My 1,000,000 yen vase...

13:31.900 --> 13:32.600
Hey, you!

13:33.050 --> 13:35.650
This is no time for that. We're here to save Mitsuki!

13:36.660 --> 13:37.780
I guess there's no other choice...

13:38.100 --> 13:40.060
Yep, you said it!

13:40.610 --> 13:41.890
They're up and running!

13:42.140 --> 13:42.920
Don't give up!

13:43.470 --> 13:44.380
Aim for the head!

13:45.520 --> 13:47.320
It's full of holes!

13:53.130 --> 13:54.560
These are all the enemies here, right?

13:54.760 --> 13:55.680
My painting...

13:58.250 --> 14:00.020
You two have done well to survive for so long!

14:00.200 --> 14:02.070
Now, we're going to play 'Kumeshin Says'!

14:02.180 --> 14:05.510
Which one does Mitsuki-chan love - roasted sweet potatoes or broiled tofu?

14:05.800 --> 14:06.750
Shut up, idiot!

14:06.920 --> 14:07.280
Die!

14:08.860 --> 14:11.030
Well, if it isn't the boy who would be "Die Hard" John McClane.

14:11.340 --> 14:14.500
Mitsuki-chan is naked and quite refreshed in the observatory on the top floor!

14:14.650 --> 14:16.220
If you don't like it, come and get her.

14:18.470 --> 14:20.640
They really don't seem like a team of bodyguards anymore.

14:20.920 --> 14:22.270
At any rate, we're going to save her!

14:22.830 --> 14:24.470
But where's the observatory?

14:25.720 --> 14:27.330
On the roof, of course!

14:33.180 --> 14:34.800
Ah, that vase, and that painting was 10,000,000 yen!

14:34.800 --> 14:37.820
What are they going to do about that?!

14:38.050 --> 14:40.500
What the hell? You're not being serious about this!

14:40.880 --> 14:43.070
Do you really want to save Mitsuki?

14:43.190 --> 14:44.120
If course I do!

14:44.520 --> 14:46.180
You maids are my possessions!

14:46.470 --> 14:48.790
You think I can stay quiet while someone else takes you away?

14:49.050 --> 14:50.090
'Possessions'?

14:50.630 --> 14:51.810
Such a word...

14:52.220 --> 14:53.020
Yeah.

14:53.380 --> 14:57.140
We're nothing but your property, just like that picture earlier.

14:57.140 --> 14:58.930
Ah, uh, um...what do...

14:59.100 --> 15:01.160
She may be a thing to you,

15:01.610 --> 15:03.840
but to me, she's a precious little sister!

15:04.390 --> 15:05.490
You scumbag!

15:06.480 --> 15:09.220
Hey, ah... wait!

15:09.340 --> 15:10.070
Fine.

15:10.120 --> 15:13.340
If this is how it's going to be, I swear I'll get you out of here by myself!

15:13.660 --> 15:15.490
My cute little sister!

15:15.920 --> 15:16.750
Wait for me, Mitsuki.

15:16.940 --> 15:18.410
I'll come save you soon.

15:18.510 --> 15:18.970
Izumi!

15:19.870 --> 15:20.800
Look down, down!

15:21.950 --> 15:22.520
What's this?!

15:22.530 --> 15:24.590
Help me! I'm going to die!

15:25.670 --> 15:27.060
Ah, so nice and warm...

15:27.690 --> 15:28.240
I think I can see it.

15:28.260 --> 15:29.770
I guess I should get out soon.

15:28.520 --> 15:29.770
I can see it!

15:34.300 --> 15:36.320
I'm so thankful to be alive...

15:37.030 --> 15:38.310
Don't follow me!

15:38.440 --> 15:39.740
I'll do it myself!

15:39.870 --> 15:41.300
Don't look up my skirt from there!

15:41.900 --> 15:43.080
Hey, wait, hold on!

15:44.260 --> 15:45.250
Ah, this is so nice.

15:45.830 --> 15:51.780
If I can work here, taking a bath with Izumi-san won't be just a dream!

15:52.630 --> 15:53.730
Izumi-san...

15:55.050 --> 15:55.370
That's right!

15:55.420 --> 15:57.710
We have to go look for Izumi-san!

15:58.770 --> 15:59.610
Dammit.

15:59.700 --> 16:01.670
That damn Izumi climbed faster than I thought she could.

16:03.200 --> 16:04.010
A maid's scream!

16:04.510 --> 16:05.440
I'm coming right up!

16:09.360 --> 16:10.990
You're late, Yoshitaka.

16:11.180 --> 16:12.210
Master!

16:12.580 --> 16:13.330
Mitsuki-chan!

16:14.030 --> 16:15.200
Here's the other one!

16:15.320 --> 16:16.050
Yoshitaka!

16:19.050 --> 16:19.970
You guys!

16:20.120 --> 16:22.160
Didn't you want to help Mitsuki?

16:22.560 --> 16:24.590
This is merely a temporary measure.

16:24.640 --> 16:27.310
First, we're going to take care of you.

16:27.700 --> 16:30.600
Yoshitaka, you are an eyesore.

16:30.970 --> 16:35.160
No matter where it was, you always acted like the damn boss to our Mitsuki-chan!

16:35.740 --> 16:37.340
Colonel, your wig is slipping!

16:37.430 --> 16:38.290
Kneel before me!

16:38.320 --> 16:39.420
Beg for your life!

16:39.490 --> 16:40.770
It's useless to stand against us!

16:40.870 --> 16:42.870
He's mixing up a lot of characters...

16:42.980 --> 16:44.770
Mitsuki-chan is ours.

16:44.980 --> 16:46.980
And Izumi will serve her purpose as well.

16:47.250 --> 16:49.310
Now, give up and throw down your weapon!

16:52.590 --> 16:53.400
Yoshitaka!

16:55.630 --> 16:56.470
How unexpected!

16:57.010 --> 16:59.040
I can't believe you would risk yourself for another...

16:59.220 --> 17:00.800
You're in big trouble now!

17:00.890 --> 17:03.770
No matter what you do, you can't win against this many men.

17:04.230 --> 17:04.690
Shut up!

17:04.770 --> 17:05.670
I threw down my weapon!

17:05.770 --> 17:07.020
Release them!

17:08.130 --> 17:09.230
That won't work!

17:09.420 --> 17:10.940
You really are miserable, Yoshitaka.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.340
What should I do?

17:13.720 --> 17:17.240
At a time like this... what in the world is God doing?

17:22.610 --> 17:26.530
I can't show Izumi any more uncool sides of myself.

17:27.810 --> 17:29.500
They are my maids!

17:29.780 --> 17:32.570
You think I can keep quiet while they're being put through that?

17:33.010 --> 17:33.470
Wait for me!

17:33.770 --> 17:35.170
I'm going to save you right now!

17:39.340 --> 17:40.640
You're acting pretty damn cocky.

17:40.890 --> 17:41.690
Get him!

17:54.500 --> 17:56.830
That's "Die Hard", Kumeshin.

18:02.020 --> 18:02.740
Izumi!

18:05.520 --> 18:06.700
It's biting into me...

18:08.000 --> 18:08.910
Izumi...

18:10.380 --> 18:12.070
I'm not letting anyone take you away from me!

18:14.320 --> 18:16.670
Izumi-saaaan!

18:26.520 --> 18:27.950
Izumi-san, are you all right?

18:28.390 --> 18:31.410
Did Yoshitaka-kun do anything weird to you while you were alone with him?

18:31.780 --> 18:33.480
Pochi and I were worried...

18:37.700 --> 18:39.030
I can't believe it...

18:39.490 --> 18:40.370
She's tied up!

18:42.060 --> 18:44.330
WHAT DID YOU DO TO MY IZUMI-SAN?!

18:44.880 --> 18:47.650
Even <i>I've </i>only gotten as far as a kiss!

18:48.250 --> 18:50.920
IT SUCKS BEING SECOND!

18:51.940 --> 18:54.920
How dare you! My Izumi-san is...

18:53.900 --> 18:54.420
Wait!

18:54.520 --> 18:55.120
I-It's me!

18:55.420 --> 18:56.000
Hear me out...

18:55.810 --> 18:56.680
There you are!

18:59.270 --> 19:00.330
What's with this set?

19:00.920 --> 19:02.510
So all of this was a painted backdrop?

19:03.090 --> 19:03.390
What?

19:03.520 --> 19:04.630
What the hell?

19:04.810 --> 19:06.010
I've been tricked?!

19:06.640 --> 19:07.490
Ah, ah, Anna-chan...

19:07.810 --> 19:10.260
You also did something weird to Izumi-san, didn't you?

19:10.720 --> 19:11.230
Spit it out!

19:11.260 --> 19:12.020
What did you do?

19:12.060 --> 19:12.880
What color were they?

19:14.240 --> 19:15.270
Ah, she's going to break him.

19:15.470 --> 19:16.400
That's enough!

19:16.570 --> 19:17.650
I've achieved my goal!

19:17.820 --> 19:19.350
The survival game is over!

19:20.380 --> 19:21.300
Ah, she's not listening.

19:21.300 --> 19:22.700
What?

19:22.700 --> 19:23.680
It was a farce?

19:24.020 --> 19:24.700
That's right!

19:24.730 --> 19:26.640
I wanted to do a survival game,

19:26.790 --> 19:30.720
so I had everyone in my Bodyguard Squad cooperate and go so far as to build a set!

19:30.880 --> 19:31.750
I see...

19:32.000 --> 19:33.340
I'm sorry.

19:33.590 --> 19:36.320
It was for our... Mitsuki-chan...

19:36.740 --> 19:39.030
My paintings and vases were destroyed for this?

19:39.280 --> 19:40.300
Mitsuki!

19:40.350 --> 19:41.790
You did all this for fun?!

19:41.930 --> 19:43.210
It wasn't for fun.

19:43.460 --> 19:48.830
After all, you liked the part when Master risked his life to come save you when you were in a big pinch, right?

19:52.520 --> 19:53.180
Well?

19:53.180 --> 19:56.180
Weren't you thinking about how great Master is?

19:56.340 --> 19:58.410
Don't tell me you did all this for that!

19:58.520 --> 19:59.320
That's right!

19:59.560 --> 20:02.500
Then the love between the two of you could sprout while you were cooperating!

20:03.910 --> 20:06.090
Hey, Izumi, want to do it again?

20:06.570 --> 20:09.270
You play the female soldier taken prisoner, and I'll be the enemy officer!

20:09.540 --> 20:12.030
Ah, but first we have to consider the matter of my valuable stuff!

20:12.150 --> 20:13.680
Don't be stupid!

20:15.360 --> 20:15.920
Izumi-san?

20:17.060 --> 20:20.090
As I thought, I have to stay by your side!

20:20.490 --> 20:23.750
Please accept me as a maid here!

20:23.970 --> 20:25.880
All right, let's make a ten-year contract!

20:26.030 --> 20:28.630
If you break it before completion, damages will be in the amount of thirty year's wages and...

20:29.540 --> 20:32.210
IS THAT WHAT YOU CALL A CONTRACT?!

20:35.520 --> 20:37.030
Izumi-san's so sexy!

20:37.120 --> 20:37.820
Chance!

20:38.880 --> 20:39.650
Anna-chan, here!

20:39.650 --> 20:40.860
Sign here!

20:41.220 --> 20:41.620
All right.

20:41.880 --> 20:43.770
And stamp here.

20:45.810 --> 20:46.990
No way...

20:47.350 --> 20:48.870
That was a nice assist.

20:49.420 --> 20:51.320
Now serve me like that from now on.

20:51.570 --> 20:53.010
Someday you can work in my bedroom doing...

20:53.250 --> 20:58.030
You dirty pervert, dirty pervert, dirty pervert, dirty pervert, dirty pervert, dirty pervert, dirty pervert!

20:58.290 --> 20:59.980
WHO WOULD DO THAT WITH YOU?!

21:00.370 --> 21:03.230
You think I want that kind of love-comedy twist?

21:03.470 --> 21:07.400
Couples formed under extraordinary circumstances don't last long!

21:07.820 --> 21:09.250
Why are you talking about a love-comedy?

21:09.600 --> 21:11.060
And forming a couple?

21:11.220 --> 21:12.950
Onee-chan, are you hiding your embarrassment?

21:13.130 --> 21:14.180
Shut up!

21:14.390 --> 21:16.950
For now, just DIE!

21:26.870 --> 21:29.430
Mitsuki, go to sleep already.

21:30.120 --> 21:31.240
Yeah, just a little longer.

21:32.090 --> 21:34.980
He took a lot of interesting pictures today.

21:36.860 --> 21:38.040
This is nice!

21:38.270 --> 21:40.440
And I have to submit these, too!

21:42.170 --> 21:43.450
I have mail.

21:42.170 --> 21:43.620
Froggy says: "You have mail!" ;)

21:44.120 --> 21:46.350
Let's see... "I saw your site.

21:46.630 --> 21:50.110
Can you send me some pictures of Sawatari Izumi-san?"

21:50.850 --> 21:51.640
All right!

21:51.770 --> 21:52.840
Treasure them, all right?

21:58.000 --> 22:00.720
Dammit, I saved that Izumi and didn't get a single damn word of appreciation!

22:00.820 --> 22:01.530
She owes me for that!

22:02.320 --> 22:13.090
Izumi's debt from today

22:06.310 --> 22:13.090
How much Izumi has left before she pays off her debt

22:27.380 --> 22:30.810
見た目の甘さほどは

22:27.380 --> 22:30.810
mitame no amasa hodo ha

22:27.380 --> 22:30.810
They only appear sweet for a moment

22:30.820 --> 22:34.560
儚いとか 弱くもないから

22:30.820 --> 22:34.560
hakanai to ka yowaku mo nai kara

22:30.820 --> 22:34.560
and they're not weak either.

22:34.590 --> 22:39.530
女の子は結構頑丈よ

22:34.590 --> 22:39.530
onnanoko ha kekkou ganjou yo

22:34.590 --> 22:39.530
Girls are pretty stable.

22:41.610 --> 22:44.820
意地っ張り空回りを

22:41.610 --> 22:44.820
ijippari karamawari wo

22:41.610 --> 22:44.820
Because they're stubborn,

22:44.900 --> 22:48.680
楽しめちゃう余裕も大事ネ!

22:44.900 --> 22:48.680
tanoshimechau yoyuu mo daiji ne!

22:44.900 --> 22:48.680
they can enjoy getting nothing done; free time is precious, too.

22:48.690 --> 22:53.410
笑顔にはたっぷりのスパイスが

22:48.690 --> 22:53.410
egao ni ha tappuri no SUPAISU ga

22:48.690 --> 22:53.410
Is there a good deal of spice in that smile?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.740
どうかナ?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.740
dou ka na?

22:54.110 --> 22:55.740
I wonder...

22:56.020 --> 23:02.140
常識など壊す刺激的なヒミツ

22:56.020 --> 23:02.140
joushiki nado kowasu shigekitekina himitsu

22:56.020 --> 23:02.140
The stimulating secret that smashes common sense,

23:02.270 --> 23:09.760
スカートでそっと巧く隠してる

23:02.270 --> 23:09.760
SUKATTO de sotto umaku kakushiteru

23:02.270 --> 23:09.760
is well-concealed within their skirts.

23:09.860 --> 23:16.640
愛情のカタマリでこの気持ち出来てる

23:09.860 --> 23:16.640
aijou no katamari de kono kimochi dekiteru

23:09.860 --> 23:16.640
I have a feeling this can be a mass of love.

23:16.900 --> 23:23.620
キュんとなるシュンカンを夢みていたいから

23:16.900 --> 23:23.620
KYUN to naru shunkan wo yume miteitai kara

23:16.900 --> 23:23.620
Because I want to have dreams of this moment, that will not matter.

23:23.940 --> 23:30.950
愛情のカタマリでオトメは進化する

23:23.940 --> 23:30.950
aijou no katamari de otome ha shinka suru

23:23.940 --> 23:30.950
The maidens grow in a mass of love,

23:31.010 --> 23:38.060
トキメキもカガヤキも抱きしめているから

23:31.010 --> 23:38.060
TOKIMEKI mo kagayaki mo dakishimeteiru kara

23:31.010 --> 23:38.060
because they are embracing their glowing excitement.

23:44.910 --> 23:48.970
By now, we've really settled in Yoshitaka-kun's house.

23:49.100 --> 23:49.960
We really have.

23:50.200 --> 23:51.240
Wait, that's bad!

23:51.270 --> 23:51.740
That's bad!

23:51.850 --> 23:53.700
Does that mean we've played right into his hands?

23:53.780 --> 23:54.550
No, you're wrong!

23:54.670 --> 23:56.980
All the stuff I arranged was to deal with my daily stress!

23:57.070 --> 23:59.860
A lot of people showed up and things got really busy, didn't they?

24:00.050 --> 24:02.180
But days like today are a little...

24:02.630 --> 24:03.460
Ah, I see!

24:03.540 --> 24:05.750
Then it's about time for them to come, right?

24:05.950 --> 24:07.260
I have a trap set!

24:07.410 --> 24:08.510
Who the hell is coming?

24:08.080 --> 24:13.080
There's a rumor that this boy in the midst of puberty who inherited his parents' fortune and is living all by himself with no supervision has surrounded himself with tender young girls in a huge mansion, thus living out his fantasies and creating his own world of desire as he makes them serve him.

24:08.700 --> 24:11.330
I have a feeling a lot more interesting things are going to happen.

24:11.470 --> 24:12.510
I'm excited!
